# Cloudflare Worker local secrets (`vite dev`). Never commit these files.
#
# Against devnet: copy to .dev.vars and set the two secrets. wrangler.jsonc
# lists them in `secrets.required`, so .dev.vars only supplies those two.
#
# Against a local `thruput node` (port 9745): copy to .dev.vars.local, set
# the secrets and the local-node block below, and run
#   CLOUDFLARE_ENV=local node node_modules/vite/bin/vite.js dev --port 5174
# The `local` env reads every key from .dev.vars.local.

# ── Secrets (`wrangler secret put` in production) ─────────────────────────
# Relay lanes: comma-separated 32-byte Ed25519 seeds (hex), one per lane.
# `bun worker/ops/relay-keys.ts --secrets` prints it (to a pipe only). Each key
# pays gas (reserved, not burned). Keep >= 9 HOG free per in-flight
# 36,000-frame run (RELAY_MAX_IN_FLIGHT per lane).
RELAY_SECRETS=
# Guards /api/admin/* (sync, seed touch). Omit to disable those routes.
DEV_API_KEY=

# ── Local node (.dev.vars.local only) ─────────────────────────────────────
# Ids are base58 (hex also works).
# THRUPUT_RPC_URL=http://127.0.0.1:9745
# SCORE_CONTRACT=<base58>
# TOKEN_CONTRACT=<base58>
# EXPLORER_URL=http://127.0.0.1:9745
